\\(10\\) is calculated by multiplying the two numbers. \n\n\\[\n72 \\times 10 = 720\n\\]\n\nVerification using the distributive property:\n\\[\n72 \\times 10 = 70 \\times 10 + 2 \\times 10 = 700 + 20 = 720\n\\]\n\nAlternatively, breaking down \\(72\\) into \\(70 + 2\\):\n\\[\n(70 + 2) \\times 10 = 70 \\times 10 + 2 \\times 10 = 700 + 20 = 720\n\\]\n\nAll methods confirm the result is \\(720\\).\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{720}\n\\]\n\n<|end_of_solution|>",
