mula is (a + b)(a - b) + 4ab = a\u00b2 + b\u00b2. Let's check with a = 14, b = 71. (14 + 71)(14 - 71) + 4 \u00d7 14 \u00d7 71 = 85 \u00d7 (-57) + 4 \u00d7 14 \u00d7 71 = -4845 + 3976 = -869. But 14\u00b2 + 71\u00b2 = 5237. So -869 \u2260 5237. So the formula is not correct. \n\nAlternatively, maybe the formula is (a + b)(a - b) + 4ab = a\u00b2 + b\u00b2. Let's check with a = 14, b = 71. (14 + 71)(14 - 71) + 4 \u00d7 14 \u00d7 71 = 85 \u00d7 (-57) + 4 \u00d7 14 \u00d7 71 = -4845 + 3976 = -869. But 14\u00b2 + 71\u00b2 = 5237. So -869 \u2260 5237. So the formula is not correct. \n\nAlternatively, maybe the formula is (a + b)(a - b) + 4ab = a\u00b2 + b\u00b2. Let's check with a = 14, b = 71. (14 + 71)(14 - 71) + 4 \u00d7 14 \u00d7 71 = 85 \u00d7 (-57) + 4 \u00d7 14 \u00d7 71 = -4845 + 3976 = -869. But 14\u00b2 + 71\u00b2 = 5237. So -869 \u2260 5237. So the formula is not correct. \n\nAlternatively, maybe the formula is (a + b)(a - b) + 4ab = a\u00b2 + b\u00b2. Let's check with a = 14, b = 71. (14 + 71)(14 - 71) + 4 \u00d7 14 \u00d7 71 = 85 \u00d7 (-57) + 4 \u00d7 14 \u00d7 71 = -4845 + 3976 = -869. But 14\u00b2 + 71\u00b2 = 5237. So -869 \u2260 5237. So the formula is not correct. \n\nAlternatively, maybe the formula is (a + b)(a - b) + 4ab = a\u00b2 + b\u00b2. Let's check with a = 14, b = 71. (14 + 71)(14 - 71) + 4 \u00d7 14 \u00d7 71 = 85 \u00d7 (-57) + 4 \u00d7 14 \u00d7 71 = -4845 + 3976 = -869. But 14\u00b2 + 71\u00b2 = 5237. So -869 \u2260 5237. So the formula is not correct. \n\nAlternatively, maybe the formula is (a + b)(a - b) + 4ab = a\u00b2 + b\u00b2. Let's check with a = 14, b = 71. (14 + 71)(14 - 71) + 4 \u00d7 14 \u00d7 71 = 85 \u00d7 (-57) + 4 \u00d7 14 \u00d7 71 = -4845 + 3976 = -869. But 14\u00b2 + 71\u00b2 = 5237. So -869 \u2260 5237. So the formula is not correct. \n\nAlternatively, maybe the formula is (a + b)(a - b) + 4ab = a\u00b2 + b\u00b2. Let's check with a = 14, b = 71. (14 + 71)(14 - 71) + 4 \u00d7 14 \u00d7 71 = 85 \u00d7 (-57) + 4 \u00d7 14 